pinyon-shift-fh1-render-test-v1
# Car physics oracle steering step (docs/specs/CAR_PHYSICS.md,
# SPEC-CAR-PHYSICS): free roam on acc9-stock (stock R34) as
# fh1-physics-accel: wake the car, full throttle from frame 1100 for 2 s,
# then off the throttle with the left stick fully left from 1220 to 1460
# (4 s) and centred again until 1580. Run with
#   --game-argument=--pinyon_shift_physics_trace=1
#   --game-argument=--pinyon_shift_physics_oracle=true
#   --game-argument=--pinyon_shift_physics_oracle_snapshot_frame=1095
#   --game-argument=--pinyon_shift_physics_oracle_trace_ticks=600
# The oracle's body trace gives the steering control, the yaw rate and the
# wheels' slip angles and lateral forces through the step and its release.
# clock-hz 60
input 0 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 360 1000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 366 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 480 1000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 486 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 600 1000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 606 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 720 1000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 726 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 780 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
wait 900 3000 vehicle
capture 1090 start
input 1100 0000 0 255 0 0 0 0
input 1220 0000 0 0 -32768 0 0 0
input 1460 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
capture 1580 end
stop 1590
